meta {
  name: Get Provider
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/public/providers/{{bookingSlug}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Answers for any provider patients can reach (portal on, active, has a slug). `bookingOpen` is false
  while booking is paused or not ready: `types` and `locations` are then empty and `/slots` answers 404,
  but the page itself still answers. `approvalRequired` is true when the provider reviews each
  booking (`REQUIRE_APPROVAL`): the form then asks the patient to confirm a request instead of a booking. Unknown, deleted or inactive providers get the same 404.
  `specialty`, `bio`, `phone` and `whatsapp` are optional, also shown while paused. `legal` is `{ name, privacyContact, contactHours }` or null: who answers for patient data, shown before the patient authorizes anything.
  `reschedulePolicy` is `{ maxReschedules, minNoticeHours }` only while patients can reschedule (booking open,
  auto-confirm); otherwise null. `selfServe` is true only when the server runs with
  `ENABLE_SELF_SERVE=true` ("Mis citas"); there is no login channel list any more. `whatsappConfirmation`
  is true only while the WhatsApp confirm-link template is configured: otherwise the form offers email only.
}
